-- Intentionally NOT changed:
-- * quant_trade.trade_time / quant_financial_event.event_time / quant_trade_cycle
--   opened_at, closed_at, trade_time: Binance event facts already UTC.
-- * quant_order.created_at / updated_at and quant_financial_event.created_at:
--   observed history is mixed; no reliable blanket conversion.
-- * quant_execution_record / quant_reconcile_record / quant_paper_account timestamps:
--   old writers have mixed semantics.
-- * quant_strategy_position_state.updated_at, quant_open_capacity timestamps,
--   quant_strategy_runtime_lease.lease_until and notification outbox timestamps:
--   these are operational clocks compared with MySQL NOW() and remain on the
--   database-local clock intentionally.
